# The Codex home is also the Constellation source repository.
# Publish only maintained source and instructions; application state stays local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/REVIEW.md
!/.codex/
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/pull_request_template.md

# Derived files inside the maintained source subtree.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/.DS_Store
**/.venv/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.playwright-mcp/
